Package: NoLimitsR
Title: R Interface to the NoLimits.jl Nonlinear Mixed-Effects Package
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Manuel", "Huth", email = "manuel.huth@uni-bonn.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Thin wrapper around the Julia package NoLimits.jl for nonlinear
    mixed-effects analysis of longitudinal data. All NoLimits functionality is
    exposed dynamically through JuliaConnectoR; only session management and a
    small set of helpers are implemented in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: JuliaConnectoR, grid
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), png
SystemRequirements: Julia (>= 1.10)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
